astBallMaster_Screenshot2.png", "id": "1876173739873412", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393444_1876173743206745_6763138395539482801_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GbhqONRWT8IQ7kNvwEL4HJf&_nc_oc=Adlcnwc_FWFhplkdHU2fKZAhszY1_4A_HpOL1stj2eIc6IQ8Rzoh5Vwz1-IXz7ADOIg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu_G3DaadfCplwychWvh3rQDsNkAyJXugH7QW-YNBPySQ&oe=699C3273"}, {"file_name": "BlastBallMaster_Screenshot5.png", "id": "1157934832465543", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473400793_1157934839132209_1607817201009102730_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KOqHupvuCXsQ7kNvwGGirDF&_nc_oc=AdkyM4nfV-vbkFm5FKV2xKZZGIuzLNRUHNHMppXDswuUaNGj68s2MtWS0RXtK56ZqNg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvryqYGewOpi3bjKfy-SRXoQ7qP6RQ3-V_Ub4cCfa8oJw&oe=699C3316"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "BlastBallMaster_Logo (2560x1440).png", "id": "1355890215582535", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819281_1355890218915868_2056131209238582864_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7zF-jgFYkIQQ7kNvwFKFpvA&_nc_oc=Adlyd-Wj0ddCQG2ioNsYwFVeQ3S5QUVvXYAVUphv30IugmHOtqG28jF-3p4DMGWQXbY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afux0SWNIRaH6UQ0YYEFbTshtBcZtjssCA7yKW7L66AYKg&oe=699C51BD"}, "display_name": "Blast Ball Master", "keywords": ["ball", "shoot", "bubble", "match3", "puzzle"], "long_description": "Blast Ball Master is a new vision of the old school Zuma game. \nBlast Ball Master is a puzzle game with a new creative idea.\nBlast Ball Master is interactive and immersive game. Be inside VR.\nBlast Ball Master is a good choice for those who love shooting ball game.\n\nUse 4 boosters: Slow, Freeze, Explosion and Backward Moving! \nUse challenges to get free coins!\nEnjoy colorful effects! \nCool fun music!\nTry different VR hands to get an additional bonus.\nTry Blast Ball Master now!  ", "short_descrip